title: 1. A fourteen-turn live replay
eyebrow: HotelFlow tutorial
lede: "Start with a recorded booking conversation: collection, a search refinement, two exact comparison tables, return to selection, and a completed reservation."
source: pico-demo/test/hotel-flow/hotel-flow.e2e-spec.ts, pico-demo/test/hotel-flow/hotel-flow.scenario.json
---

<p>Read this first. It is a complete, passing model-backed run of the fourteen-turn scenario with <code>HOTEL_FLOW_CURRENT_DATE</code> frozen to <code>2027-07-15</code>. The collection wording can vary; the local catalogue, date policy, price calculations, direct comparison tables, and completion flag are the durable contracts.</p>

<h2 id="run-it-yourself">Run it yourself</h2>
<pre><code class="language-bash">cd pico-demo
npm run test:hotel-flow</code></pre>
<p>With <code>OPENAI_API_KEY</code> and <code>PICOFLOW_KEY</code> in <code>.env</code>, this starts the demo application, sends every scenario request through one session, semantically judges the replies, and inspects the final durable state. Without credentials, Node reports the live scenario as skipped.</p>

<h2 id="captured-live-transcript">Captured live transcript</h2>
<div class="quote-replay">
  <div class="quote-replay__header"><span class="quote-replay__dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><a href="https://github.com/picoflowio/pico-demo/blob/main/test/hotel-flow/hotel-flow.scenario.json">test/hotel-flow/hotel-flow.scenario.json</a><span>14 turns · recorded e2e</span></div>
  <ol class="quote-replay__list">
  {%- for turn in replay.turns %}
    <li class="quote-replay__turn{% if turn.completed %} quote-replay__turn--completed{% endif %}">
      <p class="quote-replay__meta">{{ loop.index }} · {{ turn.stage }}{% if turn.completed %} · completed{% endif %}</p>
      <div class="quote-replay__message quote-replay__message--you"><span class="quote-replay__who">You</span><div class="quote-replay__bubble">{{ turn.user | escape }}</div></div>
      <div class="quote-replay__message quote-replay__message--bot"><span class="quote-replay__who">Bot</span><div class="quote-replay__bubble">{{ turn.bot | renderTranscriptMarkdown | safe }}</div></div>
    </li>
  {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
</div>

<p>The final response sets <code>completed: true</code>. The current cursor is the terminal step, so a client should start a new session for another reservation.</p>

<h2 id="what-to-compare">What to compare when your replay differs</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Point</th><th>Contract</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Turns 1–7</td><td>Collection is Portland-only and dates remain after the frozen current date.</td></tr><tr><td>Turn 9</td><td>The refined two-bed search produces the current result set.</td></tr><tr><td>Turns 10–12</td><td>Comparisons are application-rendered Markdown tables, not model-invented prices.</td></tr><tr><td>Turn 14</td><td>A confirmation is generated and the session completes.</td></tr></tbody></table>

